          "filename": "Chinatown 07 (4254256278).jpg",
          "caption": "Monument to Robert Louis Stevenson — in Portsmouth Square, Chinatown, San Francisco, California.\nInscription reads:\n \"To remember Robert Louis Stevenson — To be honest to be kind - to earn a little to spend a little less - to make upon the whole a family happier for his presence - to renounce when that shall be necessary and not be embittered to keep a few friends but these without capitulation - above all on the same grim condition to keep friends with himself here is a task for all that a man has of fortitude and delicacy.\"",
